From: ALHIJRAH Canada Desk <noreply@careergate.us>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:20:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Staff command desk (owner design) on real D1 APIs;
 work-session follow-up gate; Toronto-dated billing default

- components/operations/command-desk.tsx: new dashboard layout; cases, documents, CRS, AI review, employers/vacancies,
  client notices and follow-ups from existing routes; no sample data; classic layout kept at /?view=classic
- POST /api/candidates/[id]/workflow {action:'close_session'}: 400 FOLLOW_UP_REQUIRED without a follow-up from today on
- billing payment date default/max use the Toronto office date (was UTC: rejected every evening in Toronto)
- tests: tests/v22/desk.test.mjs, operations E2E desk journey + 390px

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RQZ57XDCVxFYqkyqLENrNp
